{"overview":"سرافینا، شجاع‌ترین شوالیه غرب، انتظار شکنجه را داشت وقتی توسط بربرها اسیر می‌شود؛ اما به جای آن یک پیشنهاد ازدواج دریافت می‌کند! ازدواج با دشمن سوگند خورده‌اش قطعاً رد است! اما پس از آشنایی با فرهنگ و چهرهٔ بسیار زیبأ اسیرکنندهٔ عروسی‌اش، ممکن است وسوسه شود که شمشیرش را با حجاب عروسی عوض کند. آمادهٔ یک داستان تحول دشمنی به شاید عشق باشید.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Serafina, the West’s fiercest knight, expected torture when captured by barbarians. Instead, she got a marriage proposal! Marrying her sworn enemy is a hard no! But after seeing her wedding captor’s culture and very pretty face, she may be tempted to swap her sword for a wedding veil. Get ready for the ultimate enemies-to-maybe-lovers arc.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2026,"poster":"/aX6bcboTSrptEAnI3FaeEmpAHta.jpg"}],"episodes":12,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"鈴代紗弓","role":"Serafina de Lavillant (voice)","photo":"/7wEX0bXCs2djnp0dKsCqmMKZpZV.jpg","en":"Sayumi Suzushiro"},{"name":"猪股慧士","role":"Veor (voice)","photo":"/hAoRLGuberMhFY1f6ULJGiIu1e.jpg","en":"Satoshi Inomata"},{"name":"هانا هیشیکاوا","role":"Cersei (voice)","photo":"/epCzuP9ZmBMonKK2Z6FOKoq2b7k.jpg","en":"Hana Hishikawa"},{"name":"豊崎愛生","role":"Alyssa Malcius (voice)","photo":"/crZpbb0ILJnH7mIYZV2l4uqQx1J.jpg","en":"Aki Toyosaki"}],"trailer":"aGfTiczYsmo","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/273467/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/qHLLmKo7udRgiSnIASVTwP2IxfJ.png"},{"n":"Amazon Video","kind":"buy","logo":"/jn6TLbtaTZntTRX9UYucHJvpQx1.png"},{"n":"Apple TV Store","kind":"buy","logo":"/qdEGArH3lKfFnAtYXMkSYk5wxuG.png"},{"n":"Fandango At Home","kind":"buy","logo":"/wpOt6x0dRxTrIzuBosto4LGd7E9.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/273467/watch?locale=GB","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind